back/branch and marginal-precision policy. Never auto-run `final`.\n\n**§5 Evidence format** — Full append-only `candidates.jsonl` schema (parent, source_sha256, hypothesis, static validation, per-workload correctness+speedup, geomean, decision, cumulative evals, skill usage) with recording rules.\n\n**§6–§7** — Per-candidate execution checklist and the immediate next action (implement + evaluate c001), which is deferred to a future turn per your instruction to stop after the plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":36961,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ec061ce-2791-4f7d-a8c3-c9fc1591fd58","uuid":"39a881b8-f208-4a5b-a7e9-572df84f2a0b","timestamp":"2026-09-16T14:25:41.301Z"}
